WEBVTT

1
00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.985
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Izzy, you look worried.

2
00:00:22.427 --> 00:00:23.224
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Do I?

3
00:00:32.315 --> 00:00:34.384
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Is everything OK?

4
00:00:35.116 --> 00:00:38.972
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yes…No.

5
00:00:47.978 --> 00:00:50.714
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Can you still come tonight?

6
00:00:50.908 --> 00:00:52.243
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Of course.

7
00:01:01.184 --> 00:01:02.950
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> See you later.

8
00:01:03.209 --> 00:01:04.976
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> See you.

9
00:01:13.765 --> 00:01:15.209
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thanks for coming.

10
00:01:15.316 --> 00:01:16.889
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Thanks for inviting me.

11
00:01:26.239 --> 00:01:28.437
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> What are you doing these days?

12
00:01:28.695 --> 00:01:32.271
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I’m working…as a bike courier.